Recommends: python3-yaml, pkgconf
Replaces: tcspecial-ground, tcspecial-moc
Conflicts: tcspecial-ground, tcspecial-moc
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/vomlehn/tcspecial
Description: TCSpecial MOC Correspondent: what a ground station is built on
 What a ground station for tcspecial is built on: libtcsmoc-c, the TCSpecial
 MOC Correspondent (tcsmoc) for C and C++, with its header tcsmoc-c.h
 and pkg-config file tcsmoc-c.pc; the Python packages tcsprotocol (TCS
 Link Support) and tcsmoc (the Correspondent); and the schemas of the
 configuration files they read. Operational code alone: the configuration
 editor and checker are the tcs-tools package. Everything is under /opt/tcs.
 /etc/ld.so.conf.d/tcsmoc.conf puts /opt/tcs/lib on the loader's path, a .pth
 file puts the Python packages on python3's, and /etc/profile.d/tcsmoc.sh
 puts /opt/tcs/lib/pkgconfig on pkg-config's.
